{"productId": "a90a86e1-f245-4e5a-a2fa-7b9be63e84e8", "modelName": "X-Bolt 2 Micro", "modelDescription": "With a solid reputation as a reliable, accurate, bolt-action hunting rifle, a Browning X-Bolt is tough to beat. The new X-Bolt 2 will be even harder to surpass \u2014 in this instance for even more shooters. Shooting a rifle that fits correctly is essential for total accuracy and maximum shooting comfort. The new Browning X-Bolt 2 features the new Vari-Tech stock features three-way adjustment to dial-in the fit to meet your needs. Adjustments can be easily made to the comb height to dial-in the alignment between your eye and optics. Length of pull is adjusted internally with spacers for a solid, rattle-free feel. Even the grip angle can be changed by switching between the sporter and vertical grip modules. On the subject of grip, rubber overmolding on the gripping surfaces provides added security in all conditions. A shorter 1\" Inflex Recoil Pad allows the length of pull to drop to a minimum of 12-7/8\". While smaller shooters and those who hunt in climates that require additional layers of clothing will benefit from the Vari-Tech stock, the Micro also has a barrel that is 2\" shorter than standard to reduce weight. The shorter barrel makes the rifle easier to handle and even lighter, perfect for smaller shooters and gram-counting backcountry hunters. The radial muzzle brake uses 5/8\"x24 barrel threading that also makes it simple to add a suppressor.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "4210f4f9-1978-4482-8c3b-1f3586106b20", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt 2 Micro, Bolt Action, 6.8 Western, 22\" Threaded Barrel, Muzzle Brake, Blued Finish, Black Composite Stock, Right Hand, 3 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/385605a0-ff4a-4051-956f-65dc438dd0e1", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/068e62f2-46ae-45c1-9cf4-240407e49c7d", "https://ma